tMapHash":286463850,"text":"Who're you? This is my seat, and everyone in the tavern knows it.","nextNodeIds":[760150102]},{"nodeId":760150102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":2081500490,"text":"Did you only just report in on the island or something? You can't just turn up and take someone else's spot!","nextNodeIds":[760150103]},{"nodeId":760150103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":2636374890,"text":"Also, where the devil's my beer? Hurry it up, would ya? I'm going out on patrol soon.","nextNodeIds":[760150104,760150105]},{"nodeId":760150104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2996405874,"text":"Tavern? Beer?","nextNodeIds":[760150106]},{"nodeId":760150106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":3449770002,"text":"If you must have it! But first, come and drink and sing with us. Once we're friends, sit anywhere you please!","nextNodeIds":[760150107]},{"nodeId":760150107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":3213169290,"text":"You know the tune, right? Yo-ho, come on now! We'll sing one line, you'll sing the next!","nextNodeIds":[760150108]},{"nodeId":760150108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":3725339146,"text":"\"The sound of dancing drifted from my neighbors', it set my feet a-tapping, oh!\"","nextNodeIds":[760150109,760150110,760150111]},{"nodeId":760150109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":702162482,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[760150112]},{"nodeId":760150112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":1550865370,"text":"No, no, no! Are you serious? Everyone from Nod-Krai knows this song, come on!","nextNodeIds":[760150113]},{"nodeId":760150113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":1224257546,"text":"If you don't sing and have some fun, you're not gonna fit in, y'know? An' things don't go so good for soldiers without buddies when the Wild Hunt strikes.","nextNodeIds":[760150114]},{"nodeId":760150114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":571995274,"text":"Go learn the song, then come back here, you got that? Ya-hey! Hit me with another beer, come on!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":760150110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1712827210,"text":"\"My buddy Paimon's a funny gal, she sets me laughing, ho-ho-ho!\"","nextNodeIds":[760150112]},{"nodeId":760150111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1405855450,"text":"\"The island ghosts gather 'round the chair, singing and dancing to and fro!\"","nextNodeIds":[760150112]},{"nodeId":760150105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1723599890,"text":"Just lend me the seat for a bit, would you?","nextNodeIds":[760150106]}]},{"talkId":7601502,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":1,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":true,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTal