hantom","textMapHash":3277341610,"text":"If you must have it! But first, come and drink and sing with us. Once we're friends, sit anywhere you please!","nextNodeIds":[760150207]},{"nodeId":760150207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":255241298,"text":"You know the tune, right? Yo-ho, come on now! We'll sing one line, you'll sing the next!","nextNodeIds":[760150208]},{"nodeId":760150208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":3796439810,"text":"\"The sound of dancing drifted from my neighbors', it set my feet a-tapping, oh!\"","nextNodeIds":[760150209]},{"nodeId":760150209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3455465018,"text":"\"You're all smiling, the fiddle I'm playing,\"","nextNodeIds":[760150210]},{"nodeId":760150210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":925391130,"text":"\"And we're all dancing to and fro!\"","nextNodeIds":[760150211]},{"nodeId":760150211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":79346314,"text":"\"Come crowd around, let's dance away!\"","nextNodeIds":[760150212]},{"nodeId":760150212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":2228754882,"text":"Haha! That's right, that's the way! You're quick on the uptake!","nextNodeIds":[760150213]},{"nodeId":760150213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":3217097298,"text":"The name's ███. Well, that makes us acquainted. The chair's all yours — I'm a generous fellow, after all!","nextNodeIds":[760150214]},{"nodeId":760150214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":3822035882,"text":"You're a Ratnik too, eh? Don't worry, this drink's on me. Maybe we'll see each other again during training.","nextNodeIds":[760150215,760150216]},{"nodeId":760150215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4247293874,"text":"Thank you — even though I can't drink it.","nextNodeIds":[760150217]},{"nodeId":760150217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15550,"speakerName":"Loud Phantom","textMapHash":3338631354,"text":"Well, I'm heading out on patrol. See you!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":760150216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1314208098,"text":"Well met, sir. You may call me Flins.","nextNodeIds":[760150217]},{"nodeId":760150205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1318403386,"text":"And if I say I want to sit here?","nextNodeIds":[760150206]}]},{"talkId":7601505,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":true,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["7601501","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["2","1","76015","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_QUEST_VAR_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type"